          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa7n",
          "text": "If you or a loved one suffers injuries due to a property owner’s negligence, Dormer Harpring may be able to help. Boulder property owners and managers owe some visitors a duty to protect or warn them about hazardous conditions on their properties. When property owners and managers fail to do so, there are legal remedies that may permit you to receive injury compensation.",
