        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa8h",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring accepts a limited number of cases, which allows us to focus on our clients as people, not numbers. Become one of our clients today and discover the difference of a service-oriented legal practice. Retaining our team for your premises liability claim gives you the freedom to focus on your health, well-being, and overall recovery.",
