      "_key": "ba8m",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa8l",
          "text": "A premises liability claim is a civil legal action. It arises from an injury accident occurring on any type of property, including:",
