    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ba9h",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9g",
          "text": "Not every injured visitor can file a premises liability claim. In some cases, property owners owe visitors little or no obligation to keep a safe property for or even warn of a dangerous or hazardous condition.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ba9j",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9i",
          "text": "Establishing a Premises Liability Claim",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ba9l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9k",
          "text": "Legally, there are three types of visitors to a premises. By Colorado law, a property owner or possessor owes each of these visitors a different duty of care. The three types of visitors to a property are invitees, licensees, and trespassers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ba9n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9m",
          "text": "The duty of care owed to each visitor is generally the following:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ba9q",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9o",
          "text": "Invitees.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9p",
          "text": " Invitees are typically retail customers. Owners and operators of businesses need to maintain a reasonably safe property for invitees.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ba9t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9r",
          "text": "Licensees.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9s",
          "text": " Licensees are usually social guests. Owners owe licensees a duty to protect or notify them of dangerous conditions that they know of or should know of.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ba9w",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9u",
          "text": "Trespassers.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9v",
          "text": " Trespassers enter a property without the owner’s permission. Owners owe trespassers little to no duty.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ba9y",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sa9x",
          "text": "An injured victim must suffer actual injuries because the property owner or possessor failed to meet their duty of care to file a compensation claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
